  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a895a1114cef599b0ba51c3425fe3bed71a62d6e81c67a5c2bea4e71e5ed7424",
      "text": "TV节目时尚环节的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c28df2147930f75b2fc3040a18f766818c0c1229ceec276fda37fb2688e8c51f",
      "text": "呐呐，●●●●プロデューサー！\n还没到正式开拍吗？心里超级小鹿乱撞♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af1ef9b74b6a82ed8962c74a64d264c7becb59f05abcfcfe463be0291fcb4ee7",
      "text": "马上就要开始了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bcec43d078c82bb03915de7b0f6b8f29b596276326b806e2dfae176ae2ced41",
      "text": "嗯！我呀，\n超级期待今天的工作呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3971646b025aa7f4e4be4e79cf4dfa6f1db6d5a4884028056b67baf6174a9544",
      "text": "能在热门电视节目里为各种各样的人搭配造型哦？\n很厉害对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5443579ed19b211c6619e23fe1652aa4a5f1203b92c2ab3fc6fe4db2fe350d3b",
      "text": "呵呵，确实呢。\n负责搭配的对象是普通素人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1300b09fc3474b27cbdeae5af196d15f9d6a524a16eb111110393ecf15793aad",
      "text": "咲先生很熟悉流行潮流，大家一定都很期待\n你会选出什么样的衣服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a592897d05fde0de1b2352ca3e4e18c6b5255e565b2ef8d92a2d628268aca4f3",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，我一定要把大家都\n打扮得超——级可爱♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be42f01267e16379012bac5bbaffc907e8e72eb9dbd159e30aef45f3c474c973",
      "text": "……啊，拍摄好像终于要开始了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，我出发啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000067:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219",
      "text": "拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf394f150150930570203714169d800a15e10691d10e4e61c76ff415468dd984",
      "text": "哇！超级可爱～！\n我就觉得这件衣服绝对超适合你的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:434913f02c2ed159e73c42564f0ce4427f30e31a18e8a70aea9074fdbab23649",
      "text": "（咲先生的搭配大受好评！\n工作取得了圆满成功）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
